      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>卡钻、井漏和气侵发生前，扭矩、立管压力、流量、转速等信号通常已出现微弱异常，但司钻同时监控十几条曲线，固定阈值既会漏掉缓变前兆，也会被接单根和开停泵触发误报。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 220\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"传统流程与智能介入对比\">\n  <defs><marker id=\"ar-d2\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 4L0 8Z\" fill=\"#b46d3b\"/></marker></defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"18\" width=\"380\" height=\"184\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f5f3ec\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"410\" y=\"18\" width=\"222\" height=\"184\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n  <text x=\"25\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">当前人工路径</text>\n  <text x=\"427\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">智能介入点</text>\n  <rect x=\"25\" y=\"66\" width=\"96\" height=\"53\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#536267\">同时看曲线</text>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#213033\">10+</text><rect x=\"137\" y=\"66\" width=\"96\" height=\"53\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <text x=\"185\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#536267\">固定阈值</text>\n  <text x=\"185\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#213033\">误报高</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"66\" width=\"96\" height=\"53\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <text x=\"297\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#536267\">事故损失</text>\n  <text x=\"297\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#213033\">小时—天</text>\n  <path d=\"M25 139h335\" stroke=\"#d6d1c6\"/><path d=\"M25 157h255\" stroke=\"#d6d1c6\"/>\n  <text x=\"25\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#536267\">经验驱动 → 结果不一致 → 复核成本高</text>\n  <path d=\"M373 108h31\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#ar-d2)\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"100\" r=\"21\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\"/>\n  <text x=\"445\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">AI</text>\n  <path d=\"M475 100h28\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n  <text x=\"512\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#213033\">候选缩圈</text>\n  <text x=\"512\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#213033\">置信度排序</text>\n  <text x=\"512\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#213033\">人工决策</text>\n  <path d=\"M427 150h189\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#356354\">人负责异常确认与工程约束</text>\n</svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图</b><span>把传统人工路径与智能介入点放在同一条价值链上：AI 负责缩圈和排序，人负责工程约束与最终决策。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>多变量时序异常检测学习正常工况基线，把偏离模式合成为可解释异常分数，并在越过阈值时指出主要触发通道和提前量。预警只用于提示复核，不直接控制钻机。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 170\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"智能方法介入流程\">\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">多源观测</text>\n  <path d=\"M20 38h600\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"33.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"77.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">实时多通道</text>\n    <text x=\"77.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">01</text>\n    <path d=\"M122.5 82h7\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"130.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"174.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">工况识别</text>\n    <text x=\"174.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">02</text>\n    <path d=\"M219.5 82h7\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"227.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"271.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">正常基线</text>\n    <text x=\"271.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">03</text>\n    <path d=\"M316.5 82h7\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"324.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n    <text x=\"368.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">异常评分</text>\n    <text x=\"368.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">04</text>\n    <path d=\"M413.5 82h7\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"421.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n    <text x=\"465.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">阈值预警</text>\n    <text x=\"465.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">05</text>\n    <path d=\"M510.5 82h7\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"518.5\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"48\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"562.5\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#213033\">司钻复核</text>\n    <text x=\"562.5\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">06</text>\n    \n  <path d=\"M20 135h600\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#356354\">最终输出：风险等级、提前量与触发通道</text>\n  <text x=\"620\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b46d3b\">HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP</text>\n</svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图</b><span>智能方法不是替代整个石油工序，而是嵌入一个可定义的子问题：输入多源观测，输出候选、风险或几何。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p>需要秒级多通道钻井数据、工况标签、事故台账与处理过程。异常样本非常少，必须把正常接单根、起下钻等操作段显式标记，否则模型会把正常工况变化当异常。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据准备矩阵\">\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"624\" height=\"194\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f8f7f2\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">DATA READINESS · 数据准备就绪度</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"54\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"48\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">扭矩</text>\n    <rect x=\"36\" y=\"81\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"36\" y=\"81\" width=\"70\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".76\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"54\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"168\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">立压</text>\n    <rect x=\"156\" y=\"81\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"156\" y=\"81\" width=\"70\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".76\"/><rect x=\"264\" y=\"54\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"278\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b46d3b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"288\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">流量</text>\n    <rect x=\"276\" y=\"81\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"276\" y=\"81\" width=\"58\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#d1a23f\" opacity=\".76\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"54\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"398\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b46d3b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"408\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">转速</text>\n    <rect x=\"396\" y=\"81\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"396\" y=\"81\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#d1a23f\" opacity=\".76\"/><rect x=\"504\" y=\"54\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"518\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"528\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">工况</text>\n    <rect x=\"516\" y=\"81\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"516\" y=\"81\" width=\"70\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".76\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"106\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"122\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".78\"/>\n    <text x=\"48\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">事故标签</text>\n    <rect x=\"36\" y=\"133\" width=\"78\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e9e6de\"/>\n    <rect x=\"36\" y=\"133\" width=\"70\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".76\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#536267\">建议先解决：深度/时间对齐 · 标签口径 · 异常段记录，再讨论增加模型规模。</text>\n</svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图</b><span>先检查数据的时间/深度对齐和标签口径。缺少数值可以用模型补，缺少可追溯的工程含义则无法可靠验证。</span></div><ul style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px\"><li><b>扭矩</b><span>核心输入</span></li><li><b>立压</b><span>关键约束</span></li><li><b>流量</b><span>长尾/异常</span></li><li><b>转速</b><span>空间或时间对齐</span></li><li><b>工况</b><span>人工复核依据</span></li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<p><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"高\">难度 高</span> <span class=\"small muted\">类别极端不均衡，误报成本高。高精度不够，必须同时优化提前量、误报率和可解释触发通道，并在不同钻机和地层间验证迁移。</span></p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 188\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"技术风险剖面\">\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">RISK PROFILE · 越靠右越需要验证</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#536267\">异常稀少</text>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"40\" width=\"430\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ece9e1\"/>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"40\" width=\"408.5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#b0574e\" opacity=\".76\"/>\n    <text x=\"548\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">95</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#536267\">工况混淆</text>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"71\" width=\"430\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ece9e1\"/>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"71\" width=\"356.9\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#b0574e\" opacity=\".76\"/>\n    <text x=\"548\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">83</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#536267\">跨钻机</text>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"102\" width=\"430\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ece9e1\"/>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"102\" width=\"305.3\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#d1a23f\" opacity=\".76\"/>\n    <text x=\"548\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">71</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#536267\">误报代价</text>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"133\" width=\"430\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ece9e1\"/>\n    <rect x=\"104\" y=\"133\" width=\"266.59999999999997\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".76\"/>\n    <text x=\"548\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">62</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#213033\">高难度不等于不可做：先做可解释基线，再按不确定性设置人工复核门槛。</text>\n</svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图</b><span>不同案例的卡点不同：这里把主要风险拆开，避免“模型分数很高但工程不可用”。</span></div><div class=\"refs\"><span class=\"ref\">多变量异常检测</span><span class=\"ref\">不均衡学习</span><span class=\"ref\">可解释预警</span><span class=\"ref\">迁移学习</span></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "井下复杂前兆预警：多通道异常与提前量 · 一段可复用的落地流程",
      "lead": [
        "这个案例把“D2 场景”拆成四步：先把数据变成同一时间/空间基准，再让模型缩圈，最后把不确定性和工程约束交回人。",
        "每个步骤下方都有一张对应的流程图，说明这一步实际输入什么、输出什么、最容易死在哪里。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "训练井",
          "72 口"
        ],
        [
          "通道",
          "14"
        ],
        [
          "异常事件",
          "186"
        ],
        [
          "目标",
          "提前 ≥5 min"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "多源数据对齐",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "统一时间戳和采样率，关联钻头深度、钻具组合、泵开停和事故台账。",
          "effect": "建立可追溯的井—时间—工况样本。",
          "trap": "不同服务器时钟偏移几秒，就会破坏前兆与响应的因果关系。",
          "visual": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 82\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"多源数据对齐步骤示意\">\n    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"616\" height=\"66\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f8f7f2\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"17\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">STEP 01 · 数据</text>\n    <rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"79\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">扭矩</text>\n      <path d=\"M143 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"182\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"245\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">立压</text>\n      <path d=\"M309 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"348\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"411\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">事故时间</text>\n      \n    <rect x=\"523\" y=\"37\" width=\"80\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n    <text x=\"563\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.6\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">时间误差 &lt;2 s</text>\n  </svg>"
        },
        {
          "name": "工况自动分段",
          "role": "识别",
          "do": "先把钻进、接单根、起下钻、循环等工况分开，每种工况建立独立正常基线。",
          "effect": "避免把正常操作波动当成事故前兆。",
          "trap": "只用全井统一阈值，接单根时必然产生大量误报。",
          "visual": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 82\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"工况自动分段步骤示意\">\n    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"616\" height=\"66\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f8f7f2\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"17\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">STEP 02 · 识别</text>\n    <rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"79\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">钻进</text>\n      <path d=\"M143 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"182\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"245\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">接单根</text>\n      <path d=\"M309 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"348\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"411\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">起下钻</text>\n      \n    <rect x=\"523\" y=\"37\" width=\"80\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n    <text x=\"563\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.6\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">工况 7 类</text>\n  </svg>"
        },
        {
          "name": "多变量异常评分",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "融合多通道残差与工况上下文，输出连续风险分数，并计算各通道贡献。",
          "effect": "同时发现缓变偏离和突增异常。",
          "trap": "只看单个峰值会漏掉多个通道共同偏离的早期模式。",
          "visual": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 82\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"多变量异常评分步骤示意\">\n    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"616\" height=\"66\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f8f7f2\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n    <text x=\"17\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7d898c\">STEP 03 · 算法</text>\n    <rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"79\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">通道残差</text>\n      <path d=\"M143 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"182\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"245\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">融合评分</text>\n      <path d=\"M309 50h27\" stroke=\"#b46d3b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"348\" y=\"38\" width=\"126\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e4e0d5\"/>\n      <text x=\"411\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#213033\">贡献排序</text>\n      \n    <rect x=\"523\" y=\"37\" width=\"80\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e7f2ed\" stroke=\"#a8cfc2\"/>\n    <text x=\"563\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.6\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">提前 7 min</text>\n  </svg>"
        },
        {
          "name": "分级复核与回填",
